{"title":"2026 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Including <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/1/e513adf78ee28ac3403e90a42259bc55f59e2d8f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2026$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />, how many different four-digit positive integers can be formed from the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/1/e513adf78ee28ac3403e90a42259bc55f59e2d8f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2026$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />? Note each such positive integer should have one <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, two <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />s, and one <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There aren't that many possibilities, so it's simple just to list all of the possible numbers:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/4/7143a0cdf7ab48099c12f71b784660e874dddacc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2206$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/3/6b387aceaaf20926a3dd65b599353469a538f878.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2260$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/8/ed8f33f98ab0b3b07299a1b530e07c2c3de952be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2620$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/b/47ba02743778ebfad814b9279c1512322213e2fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6220$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/a/5ba486c033167d6a1116f6557ef230c166151058.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6202$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/7/a970e7b457e756eec5b0cc6f03871ba53244606b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6022$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/1/e513adf78ee28ac3403e90a42259bc55f59e2d8f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2026$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/4/6e481b1b222a11ea6865c605a714774187ae565d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2062$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/9/dc9c1e28882668485f9092f3dc209b5b7ca02ead.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2602$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Counting, we see that there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/4/374ad4e9adc96666cde62dd31911b54d38e83c56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"20\" height=\"23\" /> numbers.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can split the problem into two cases: one where the thousands digit is a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> (since there are multiple <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />s but only one <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />), and another where the the thousands digit is a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. The leading digit cannot be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, as that would make hte\n</p><p>If the thousands digit is a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, then the other digits are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/6/2c6f941fab390e81243e1cd2b40c6178f03ab3f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$220$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> in some order, giving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/b/2cba545c06a4bf9b0e1e27e3f7134796162c0f0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3!}{2!} = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"51\" height=\"38\" /> possibilities.\n</p><p>If the thousands digit is a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, then the other digits are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/7/a27f8e69e2b25796234bcf2a48f1e170e50e3ac2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$260$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> in some order, giving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/b/4db3b59940e4f5cd42bbab2b7815c452a0197507.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3! = 6$\" width=\"47\" height=\"13\" /> possibilities.\n</p><p>There would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/2/4028c86d07a5b3bc0acb570ca13187b9917a8f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 + 6 = \\boxed{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"87\" height=\"25\" /> numbers in total.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC\" title=\"2026 CEMC CTMC\">2026 CEMC CTMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 CEMC CTMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 CEMC CTMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_1\" title=\"2026 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 1\">Individual Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_3\" title=\"2026 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 3\">Individual Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_1\" title=\"2026 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 1\">Individual 1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Individual 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_3\" title=\"2026 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 3\">Individual 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_4\" title=\"2026 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 4\">Individual 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_5\" title=\"2026 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 5\">Individual 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Individual 6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 7 (page does not exist)\">Individual 7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 8 (page does not exist)\">Individual 8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 9 (page does not exist)\">Indivi