roblems/Team Problem 18 (page does not exist)\">Team 18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 19 (page does not exist)\">Team 19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 20 (page does not exist)\">Team 20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 21 (page does not exist)\">Team 21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 22 (page does not exist)\">Team 22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 23 (page does not exist)\">Team 23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 24 (page does not exist)\">Team 24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 25 (page does not exist)\">Team 25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Canadian_Team_Mathematics_Contest\" title=\"CEMC Canadian Team Mathematics Contest\">CEMC Canadian Team Mathematics Contest</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018071113\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.037 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.055 seconds\nPreprocessor v